WHAT IS NOT HERE, AND WHY
-------------------------

No fonts. This repository has no font files at all: the samples ask for
whatever the platform draws with.

No borrowed artwork. Every icon and each application icon are hand-written SVG
in apps/Gallery/Resources/ and apps/HelloWorld/Resources/.

Nothing from the test tools. XCTest and the Swift toolchain build and check this
repository and are not part of anything shipped.


WHEN TO ADD TO THIS FILE
------------------------

Whenever something third-party is COPIED IN rather than referenced: a font, an
icon, a sound, a snippet of somebody else's code. A package reference does not
belong here; a file that ends up in the repository does.
